==English==
[[Image:Oncorhynchus mykiss.jpg|right|thumb|A '''rainbow trout'''.]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|rainbow trout|s}}

# {{lb|en|usually|countable}} A [[trout]] of the species {{taxfmt|Oncorhynchus mykiss|species}}, that has black spots and a pink streak running along the body.
# {{lb|en|usually|uncountable}} The fish as food.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|Oncorhynchus mykiss}} {{l|en|rainbow}}, {{l|en|hardhead}}, {{vern|redband trout}}, [[salmon trout]], {{vern|silver trout}}, [[steelhead]]

